<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Pointblank Macro

No Recoil for most weapon. (AUG, P90, etc)

Just place the script in the Left Button,

Choose 'Run while you hold the key' in operation mode.</Description>
    <Comment>No Recoil &amp; No Spread
</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>
LeftDown 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 45 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 45 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 50 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 50 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>